268
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:50,897
This is our fight now!

269
00:18:50,980 --> 00:18:52,098
This'll finish you.

270
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:54,260
All right, Kuma Kuma!

271
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:57,620
Bullet strength!

272
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:59,310
Oh, quit!

273
00:19:01,060 --> 00:19:02,120
Damn it!

274
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:06,460
You have to flee!

275
00:19:09,700 --> 00:19:11,640
Robin! Run away!

276
00:19:15,760 --> 00:19:17,580
Precious Metal Axe!

277
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:24,020
It's Cabbage! Forgive me.

278
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:26,027
Up till now, I was sleeping.

279
00:19:26,520 --> 00:19:28,880
You still haven't cleaned up this mess?

280
00:19:29,140 --> 00:19:30,420
Come on, Straw Hat!

281
00:19:32,700 --> 00:19:33,900
Hey, Cabbage!

282
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:37,560
Take everyone and get off the plateau!

283
00:19:38,420 --> 00:19:39,680
Are you kidding me?

284
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:42,957
Why would I do that when
Doflamingo's standing right there?

285
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:45,397
Let me fight him just one blow!

286
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:48,457
I'm leaving my friends in your hands,

287
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:52,297
my goodness—he trusts me,

288
00:19:52,380 --> 00:19:55,897
not only trust, respect!

289
00:19:55,980 --> 00:19:59,237
So

290
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:06,217
a straw

291
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:07,130
hat is my fan;

292
00:20:07,213 --> 00:20:08,937
a favor?

293
00:20:09,020 --> 00:20:12,540
favor from a fan?

294
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:16,320
Then I can't say no!

295
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:19,894
Portolomeo is still on the lower level.

296
00:20:20,060 --> 00:20:22,600
We could use his power. Let's go find him.

297
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:32,020
Can you do anything? Leo!

298
00:20:32,860 --> 00:20:34,625
Those cuts look pretty ragged.

299
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:37,555
If I can sew him up, that's something.

300
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:39,520
That could work.

301
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,600
Then I can heal him.

302
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:45,517
My watering can should fix
him up, good idea, Princess!

303
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:49,577
Thank you, but first we should
all get to safety, like Lucy said.

304
00:20:49,660 --> 00:20:51,320
Hey, Bortula, Mayo!

305
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:55,780
alright a die for mr.

306
00:20:56,000 --> 00:21:02,240
Zoro till the end of the line are you
listening to me you You're a nitwit!

307
00:21:18,480 --> 00:21:20,860
You should stop being so selfish.

308
00:21:21,520 --> 00:21:23,640
You're wasting precious time.

309
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:28,320
Your poor friend Law is
suffering because he can't die.

310
00:21:29,260 --> 00:21:34,300
Let me put him out of his misery
if you want to kill him so bad,

311
00:21:34,460 --> 00:21:36,754
then you could do it after you beat me.

312
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:41,797
Seems you're worn out already?

313
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:44,097
Wouldn't you rather just take a break?

314
00:21:44,180 --> 00:21:45,757
You're as bad off as me.

315
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:48,637
I saw that special move traffic in before?

316
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:51,080
There's no way that didn't mess you up!

317
00:22:00,100 --> 00:22:00,930
Ah!

318
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:05,840
Bazooka!

319
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:17,600
You're fast, I'll give you that.

320
00:22:18,340 --> 00:22:21,920
But your attacks don't
have nearly enough weight.

321
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:24,720
Overheat!

322
00:22:30,280 --> 00:22:32,220
It brings back memories.

323
00:22:34,220 --> 00:22:35,640
Crocodile was defeated.

324
00:22:36,740 --> 00:22:40,160
And they're telling us a
captain from Navy HQ did it.

325
00:22:40,820 --> 00:22:41,900
Not a chance.

326
00:22:42,180 --> 00:22:43,520
There must be a catch.

327
00:22:44,940 --> 00:22:47,120
Look, it's gotta be him.

328
00:22:47,660 --> 00:22:50,248
Why else would his
bounty jump up like that?

329
00:22:50,740 --> 00:22:52,780
Find out about this pirate group.

330
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:54,647
I've never heard their name.

331
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:56,640
Monkey D.

332
00:22:59,020 --> 00:23:03,180
Then you showed up at Marine
Ford, falling from the sky.

333
00:23:07,380 --> 00:23:12,300
You've done well to survive this
long, but your luck runs out today!

334
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:33,430
Stop!

335
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:36,179
I didn't expect you to wake up yet.

336
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:37,339
Are you all right?

337
00:23:38,520 --> 00:23:39,700
Put me down.

338
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:41,440
Leave me here.

339
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:45,567
And why would you want that?

340
00:23:48,220 --> 00:23:50,180
For the past 13 years,

341
00:23:50,340 --> 00:23:55,280
the only thing I've been living
for is a chance to kill Doflamingo.

342
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:12,200
I've done everything I
can, but I'm all worn out.

343
00:24:14,600 --> 00:24:18,520
So now, all that's left is
to have faith in Straw Hat.

344
00:24:21,280 --> 00:24:27,000
But if he's gonna win, then
I wanna be there to watch.

345
00:24:34,140 --> 00:24:35,700
By the same token,

346
00:24:36,200 --> 00:24:42,840
if he doesn't win, then I need to be
there so that I can die along with him.

347
00:25:07,940 --> 00:25:12,720
I'm the one who got Strahl had
involved in this whole conflict.

348
00:25:17,140 --> 00:25:19,258
That's why I have to see it through.

349
00:25:20,100 --> 00:25:20,960
So leave me.

350
00:25:23,260 --> 00:25:25,060
I don't know what to say.

351
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:31,165
Treffy, captains of a true pirate
alliance are on equal footing.

352
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:37,017
Luffy's here of his
own free will. You see?

353
00:25:37,100 --> 00:25:39,860
If he didn't want to fight, he'd refuse.

354
00:25:42,100 --> 00:25:44,860
I'm begging you, please, leave me!

355
00:25:56,900 --> 00:25:59,429
I suppose there's no
talking you out of it.

356
00:26:00,140 --> 00:26:01,787
Nico Robin, you go on ahead.

357
00:26:05,180 --> 00:26:06,010
Cabbage!

358
00:26:08,220 --> 00:26:10,808
I can't grant you a
quest if it'll kill you.

359
00:26:11,620 --> 00:26:12,860
I'll stay here, too.

360
00:26:14,520 --> 00:26:16,638
I don't want to hear any complaints.

361
00:26:17,740 --> 00:26:21,360
If you do die today, it'll be after me.

362
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:28,817
miss robin hey we should go or the lameo

363
00:26:28,900 --> 00:26:34,580
is waiting he made a path go here please

364
00:26:38,360 --> 00:26:39,480
No!

365
00:26:40,380 --> 00:26:41,320
Third gear!

366
00:26:42,580 --> 00:26:43,410
Let's go!

367
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:47,000
Come, come!

368
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:49,080
Grizzly Mother!

369
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,940
You're wide open!

370
00:27:08,520 --> 00:27:12,020
Trying to hurry so Law's
attack won't go to waste.

371
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:19,860
But even if you do defeat
them, how long will that take?

372
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:23,920
There's a one-hour limit,
but it's not that simple.

373
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:28,340
That's how long until the
birdcage fully collapses.

374
00:27:33,420 --> 00:27:36,517
but you have to think there's
plenty of sick and elderly

375
00:27:36,600 --> 00:27:40,680
people out there and babies
as well not everyone can run

376
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:47,277
the vulnerable will fall
victim quickly i'm sure

377
00:27:47,360 --> 00:27:51,677
it will only take 30 minutes
for the fatalities to

378
00:27:51,760 --> 00:27:56,477
start piling up after
40 minutes have passed i

379
00:27:56,560 --> 00:27:59,497
imagine we'll be able to
hear the screams close by.

380
00:27:59,580 --> 00:28:05,760
Then after 50 minutes, the kingdom
will be painted red, as if it were

381
00:28:10,020 --> 00:28:11,537
covered in crushed tomatoes.

382
00:28:11,620 --> 00:28:16,060
And then the screams will
die out, just one hour until

383
00:28:18,260 --> 00:28:19,737
only silence remains.

384
00:28:19,820 --> 00:28:22,380
You have nothing to do with this kingdom.

385
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:24,249
You don't owe these people

386
00:28:26,820 --> 00:28:27,650
anything.

387
00:28:27,733 --> 00:28:30,817
And yet the deaths today rest
entirely on your shoulders.

388
00:28:30,900 --> 00:28:32,700
They would still be smiling

389
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:34,900
if you hadn't come here.

390
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:37,397
My kingdom would still be at peace.

391
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:38,700
That wasn't peace.

392
00:28:38,860 --> 00:28:40,560
It It was all built on lies!

393
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:54,980
There's no place in the world
where everyone prospers.

394
00:28:55,240 --> 00:28:57,887
It's a waste of time
trying to save them all.

395
00:28:58,200 --> 00:29:00,376
You're just a pirate passing through.

396
00:29:00,520 --> 00:29:02,402
Why are you trying to play hero?

397
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:05,500
You dare pick a fight with me, Straw Hat.

398
00:29:05,840 --> 00:29:06,797
That's not true!

399
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:09,260
You're the one picking a fight with me!

400
00:29:11,760 --> 00:29:14,200
You made so many of my friends cry.

401
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:16,820
And you made my crewmates angry, too.

402
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:25,697
You'll keep hurting people
until you're stopped.

403
00:29:25,780 --> 00:29:27,580
It's time for me to step up.

404
00:29:27,800 --> 00:29:30,040
I won't let anyone else die!

405
00:29:34,760 --> 00:29:38,800
I'M KICKING YOUR ASS AND
WRECKING YOUR Baratie CAGE!

406
00:29:43,600 --> 00:29:45,200
Alright...FOURTH GEAR!
